  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MEMORIAL ROOM AND GARDEN AREA</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support the Dr Anne Merriman Memorial Room and Gardens to honour of the legacy of Dr Anne by creating an inspirational space that preserves her memory and shares the history and impact of Hospice Africa Uganda. &#xa0;The project also serves as an orientation, reflection and education point for all those planning to train and work in palliative care, including students of HAU&#x2019;s Institute of Hospice and Palliative Care in Africa (IHPCA). 
It will serve as an inspirational space for HAU team members, visitors, interns and of course patients. A place to visit and reflect. To create a valuable resource centre by gathering and maintaining palliative care publications, books, research reports, and studies in a small library within the room</narrative>
  </description>
